<title>BRAZIL: Children set fire to beggar in Rio.</title>
<headline>Children set fire to beggar in Rio.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>A beggar was set on fire in the centre of Rio de Janeiro on Thursday by a gang of children, a police spokesman said.</p>
<p>The beggar suffered burns to 70 percent of his body and stood little chance of surviving the attack. He was taken to a hospital in the centre of Rio.</p>
<p>Three people have died in Brazil since mid-April after being deliberately set on fire.</p>
</text>
